Hello Family Housing Community,

I have attached a flyer that includes the list of units that have signed up=
 to hand out candy. We have a total of 20 confirmed trick-or-treaters, but =
there is a possibility more may join in that evening!

It will take place from 5pm-7pm on Friday, October 31st.

For any that would not like their door to be knocked on that evening, you m=
ay consider turning off your porch light.

Thank you for participating in our last minute Halloween Activity!
Please reach out with any questions.

Happy Halloween,

Hana Robison
Assistant Area Coordinator
hana.kim@usu.edu
801.901.0968




