Dear Residents,
Your RAs, Judson and Jacey, along with Richard, the Area Coordinator, will =
be conducting safety and cleaning inspections on Wednesday, November 5, sta=
rting at 2:00 PM.
During this time, we will walk through each house and porch area to make su=
re everything is up to safety and fire code standards and that the space is=
 being well-maintained and clean.
Please note:

  *
You do not need to be home during the inspection, as we are not sure what t=
ime we=92ll reach each apartment.
  *
We will not go through or touch any of your personal items.
  *
No one will be fined immediately. If we notice any violations, we=92ll firs=
t provide a heads-up and a chance to fix the issue. If it hasn=92t been res=
olved by the follow-up inspection, we=92ll then discuss possible fines.

If you have any questions, please let us know. We=92re happy to help clarif=
y anything.
Thank you for your cooperation and for helping us keep our community safe a=
nd comfortable!
Jacey & Judson Mathis
Aggie Village RAs 10=9615
(801) 829-8873


