Dear Residents,
I understand that parking in our lots can sometimes be difficult and frustr=
ating, especially when spots fill up quickly. However, please make sure all=
 vehicles are parked within the painted parking lines and not in handicap s=
paces unless you have the proper permit displayed.
When cars are parked outside the lines or in unauthorized spots, it often g=
ets brought to my attention by other residents. In those cases, I=92m requi=
red to contact USU Parking (or USU Police if Parking is closed) to come out=
 and issue a ticket.
Thank you for helping keep our parking areas safe, accessible, and fair for=
 everyone.
Let me know if you have any questions!

Jacey & Judson Mathis
Aggie Village RAs 10=9615
(801) 829-8873


--_000_BYAPR07MB567267B05A2888CDFDF72B3C83E9ABYAPR07MB5672namp_
